    "Create an API key in Lemon Squeezy → Settings → API. HelpBites only reads, and leaves test-mode orders out." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Crea una clau d'API a Lemon Squeezy → Settings → API. HelpBites només llegeix i deixa fora les comandes del mode de prova."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Crea una clave de API en Lemon Squeezy → Settings → API. HelpBites solo lee y deja fuera los pedidos del modo de prueba."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lemon Squeezy → Settings → API で API キーを作成してください。HelpBites は読み取るだけで、テストモードの注文は含めません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lemon Squeezy → Settings → API에서 API 키를 만드세요. HelpBites는 읽기만 하며 테스트 모드 주문은 제외합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Lemon Squeezy → Settings → API 中创建 API 密钥。HelpBites 只读取数据，并会排除测试模式的订单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create an App Store Connect API key (Users and Access → Integrations) that can read Sales and Reports. HelpBites reads the daily sales reports, which Apple keeps for a year." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Crea una clau d'API d'App Store Connect (Users and Access → Integrations) que pugui llegir Sales and Reports. HelpBites llegeix els informes diaris de vendes, que Apple conserva durant un any."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Crea una clave de API de App Store Connect (Users and Access → Integrations) que pueda leer Sales and Reports. HelpBites lee los informes diarios de ventas, que Apple conserva durante un año."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sales and Reports を読み取れる App Store Connect API キーを作成してください（Users and Access → Integrations）。HelpBites は日次の売上レポートを読み取ります。Apple は 1 年間保持します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sales and Reports를 읽을 수 있는 App Store Connect API 키를 만드세요(Users and Access → Integrations). HelpBites는 Apple이 1년간 보관하는 일별 판매 리포트를 읽습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "创建一个可读取 Sales and Reports 的 App Store Connect API 密钥（Users and Access → Integrations）。HelpBites 会读取每日销售报告，Apple 会将其保留一年。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
