    "Fill in what you can; the assistant reads your repositories for the rest." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Omple el que puguis; l'assistent llegeix els teus repositoris per a la resta."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rellena lo que puedas; el asistente lee tus repositorios para el resto."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "わかる範囲で入力してください。残りはアシスタントがリポジトリを読んで補います。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "알고 있는 만큼만 채우세요. 나머지는 어시스턴트가 저장소를 읽고 채웁니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "能填多少填多少，其余的助手会读取你的仓库来补充。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Filled from your repos. Check those answers before you continue." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ca" : {
