    "HelpBites %@ · Beta" : {

    },
    "HelpBites never writes to your database. It tells your app instead: contact.subscription_changed and email.suppressed, signed like the action webhook (x-helpbites-signature), retried for a day." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HelpBites mai escriu a la teva base de dades. En lloc d'això n'informa la teva app: contact.subscription_changed i email.suppressed, signats com el webhook d'accions (x-helpbites-signature) i reintentats durant un dia."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HelpBites nunca escribe en tu base de datos. En su lugar avisa a tu app: contact.subscription_changed y email.suppressed, firmados como el webhook de acciones (x-helpbites-signature) y reintentados durante un día."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HelpBites があなたのデータベースに書き込むことはありません。代わりにアプリへ通知します。contact.subscription_changed と email.suppressed がアクション webhook と同じ方式で署名され（x-helpbites-signature）、1 日間再試行されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HelpBites는 여러분의 데이터베이스에 절대 쓰지 않습니다. 대신 앱에 알려 줍니다. contact.subscription_changed와 email.suppressed가 액션 webhook과 같은 방식으로 서명되어(x-helpbites-signature) 하루 동안 재시도됩니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HelpBites 从不写入你的数据库，而是通知你的应用：contact.subscription_changed 和 email.suppressed，与操作 webhook 一样签名（x-helpbites-signature），并重试一天。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HelpBites only reads from Stripe." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HelpBites només llegeix de Stripe."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HelpBites solo lee de Stripe."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HelpBites は Stripe から読み取るだけです。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HelpBites는 Stripe에서 읽기만 합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HelpBites 只从 Stripe 读取数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HelpBites opens Stripe Checkout for the price. The Stripe key needs \"Checkout Sessions: Write\"." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HelpBites obre Stripe Checkout per al preu. La clau de Stripe necessita «Checkout Sessions: Write»."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HelpBites abre Stripe Checkout para el precio. La clave de Stripe necesita «Checkout Sessions: Write»."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HelpBites はその価格で Stripe Checkout を開きます。Stripe キーには「Checkout Sessions: Write」の権限が必要です。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HelpBites가 해당 가격으로 Stripe Checkout을 엽니다. Stripe 키에 “Checkout Sessions: Write” 권한이 필요합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
