    "Variables are query parameters. Without `format=html` you get JSON: `{ subject, html, text, variables }`, ready for any mail provider." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les variables són paràmetres de consulta. Sense `format=html` obtens JSON: `{ subject, html, text, variables }`, a punt per a qualsevol proveïdor de correu."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las variables son parámetros de consulta. Sin `format=html` obtienes JSON: `{ subject, html, text, variables }`, listo para cualquier proveedor de correo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "変数はクエリパラメータです。`format=html` を付けない場合は JSON `{ subject, html, text, variables }` が返り、どのメールプロバイダでもそのまま使えます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "변수는 쿼리 매개변수입니다. `format=html`이 없으면 JSON `{ subject, html, text, variables }`을 받으며, 어떤 메일 제공업체에서든 바로 쓸 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "变量以查询参数传入。不带 `format=html` 时返回 JSON：`{ subject, html, text, variables }`，可直接用于任何邮件服务商。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Variants and weights stay as they are while the test runs." : {
      "localizations" : {
